(16)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Error:&lt;/b&gt; ts(64) · code(16) · addr(16) · data(32)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bit:&lt;/b&gt; pulse(16) · pulse_err(16) · null(16) · null_err(16)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Label Filter&lt;/b&gt; (config: LABEL_FILTER_EN + 256 bit maske): filtrelenen Word → Error RAM (LABEL_FILTERED)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;RAM'ler&lt;/b&gt; şimdilik içeride (a429_sdp_ram); we/waddr/wdata/raddr/rdata arayüzü ile dışarı alınabilir&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Değişiklikler (eski koda göre)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• timestamp Word başında alınır&lt;br&gt;• parity_mode config'te&lt;br&gt;• freeze ve drop_cnt logger'da&lt;br&gt;• hata kodu logger'da üretilir" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="300" width="290" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="3 " name="3 TX + Router + Checker"><mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1240" pageHeight="740" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="3 2" value="TX kanal, TX Router ve TX BIT Word Checker" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="1200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 3" value="TX kanal" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f3f9f1;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#3d6b2f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="560" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 4" value="&lt;b&gt;cfg_sel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;HS 100k: SLP 1&lt;br&gt;LS 12.5k: SLP 0&lt;br&gt;Custom: 0C–0F&lt;br&gt;Word sınırında APPLY&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="150" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 5" value="&lt;b&gt;tx_core (mevcut kod, sarmalayıcı ile)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;MUX1 (03) Word Builder / ext_data&lt;br&gt;MUX2 (02) Message Scheduler / ext_data_valid&lt;br&gt;MUX3 (01) Word Transmitter / Line Override&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Çıkışlar:&lt;br&gt; line_high, line_low (11 = HIGH-Z), slp, busy&lt;br&gt; word_start + word_tx[31:0], word_done&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ayrılmış giriş (G_TX_INJECT_EN):&lt;br&gt; inj_en, inj_type, inj_param&lt;br&gt; parity · kısa/uzun pulse · 31/33 bit · gap&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="110" width="330" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 6" value="cfg" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#3d6b2f;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="3 4" target="3 5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="3 7" value="&lt;b&gt;a429_tx_router&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;ROUTE_CTRL.route: 0 line driver (reset), 1 test&lt;br&gt;ROUTE_CTRL.line_idle: test sırasında NULL/HIGH-Z&lt;br&gt;ROUTE_TEST_MASK [N]  (G_RX_TEST_EN)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Test pin kodlaması (HI-8591):&lt;br&gt; HIGH → TESTA/B = 10&lt;br&gt; LOW  → 01&lt;br&gt; NULL / HIGH-Z → 11 (test modunda kalır)&lt;br&gt; kapalı → 00 (normal giriş)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="100" width="300" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 8" value="line_high/low/hiz" style="